#-- v21  (ultra rare (0.01): two dads)

~ v21_greet
{{name}}: Nice little house you got there.
{{name}}: You might be thinking. “This person is here just for room and board”. And you’re right
{{name}}: But I am not your average beggar,
{{name}}: See, I was born out of love. My two dads screened potential surrogates based on beauty and IQ.
{{name}}: Then, they mixed their sperm together and used a turkey baster.
{{name}}: To this day, we don’t know who my real dad is. Which I think is pretty amazing!
{{name}}: My dad spoiled me in the arts. I was given dance lessons, vocal lessons, anything to give me a competitive edge.
{{name}}: You might think any house in town would want me to help around, at a time like this. And you’d be right!
=> END

~ v21_tested
{{name}}: AHHHHHHHH
=> END

~ v21_rejected
{{name}}: You wouldn’t know talent if it was shoved down your throat with a silver spoon….
=> END

